# 10. MULTI-WHOLESALER CART AND ORDER PROCESSING

A customer may buy clothing from multiple approved wholesalers in one checkout.

Design the order system to support this correctly.

- Create a customer-facing parent order.
- Create separate seller order records or fulfillment groups for each wholesaler.
